                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e436f36d-51ab-33ed-8659-81d803168d26",
                                        "entry_id": "8cb2fade-cd93-3f00-94de-37f398eca19a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "federndes Sportgerät für akrobatische Sprungübungen als Freizeitvergnügen oder Wettkampfsportart"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b118daaa-f302-42b9-9fa0-0f42d13d6f3d",
                                                "sense_id": "e436f36d-51ab-33ed-8659-81d803168d26",
                                                "text": "Die Kinder toben auf dem Trampolin."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3a6fc2c-8518-4da3-b223-df11e3442b1f",
                                                "sense_id": "e436f36d-51ab-33ed-8659-81d803168d26",
                                                "text": "Um den Überschlag über den Kasten zu üben, benutzten die Mädchen der Geräteturnriege statt dem Federbrett ein kleines Trampolin, das den Absprung erleichterte."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ef5f2a3-7334-407f-a42d-7410986f06a4",
                                                "sense_id": "e436f36d-51ab-33ed-8659-81d803168d26",
                                                "text": "Ein Turner, der auf dem Trampolin den Salto übt, kann zur eigenen Sicherheit einen Saltogürtel verwenden."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b8993df5-f674-4c02-afb0-7e0c023fe6fb",
                        "source_entry_id": "0e5f28ff-d01b-386c-9797-74086c2358a6",
                        "source_sense_id": "3f37b4e4-7baa-3cb0-b58c-950fbbb30919",
                        "target_lang_word": "trampoline",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "trampoline",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d884b93e-fcc5-3211-9075-61e43577c3bf",
                                        "entry_id": "3a53d1a5-2c94-3707-9116-15561d42089e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A gymnastic and recreational device consisting of a piece of taut, strong fabric or rubber stretched over a (usually steel) frame using many coiled springs as anchors."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e93f0d4-48a4-433c-afb3-ada9734630a4",
                                                "sense_id": "d884b93e-fcc5-3211-9075-61e43577c3bf",
                                                "text": "No man was ever known to poſſeſs ſuch wonderful activity as Mr. Ireland, the flying Phœnomenon, at the Royal Circus; he poſitively leaps over a large tilted waggon and four horſes, and performs a number of other feats equally aſtoniſhing; he is a young man of about 23 years of age, 6 feet and an inch high, and does not make uſe of a ſpring board or trampoline."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "34be4353-eb41-4d80-ab98-e53f1bf89753",
                                                "sense_id": "d884b93e-fcc5-3211-9075-61e43577c3bf",
                                                "text": "Though the name of the Four Cleos may not be familiar, their pranks are. They perform on that apparatus resembling a spring mattress, which has been dubbed the “trampoline,” owing to some confusion with the Anglicised form of tremplin (springboard)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9ee3ae95-6775-3e4c-8722-5ecf3cb70b5e",
                                        "entry_id": "3a53d1a5-2c94-3707-9116-15561d42089e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A competitive sport in which athletes are judged on routines of tricks performed on a trampoline."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cc4db346-5682-3ec2-8c8a-266965eb9726",
                                        "entry_id": "3a53d1a5-2c94-3707-9116-15561d42089e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of a variety of looping or jumping instructions in specific programming languages."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7faeb9fd-12bb-3741-818a-7066fbf39a57",
                                        "entry_id": "3a53d1a5-2c94-3707-9116-15561d42089e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of a variety of indirection techniques in specific programming languages."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "trampoline",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bc60cc8b-3fc6-3662-b908-b8ee1ed63e74",
                                        "entry_id": "7cec9f49-1a5d-3042-87fd-bc9e23a75d2a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To jump (as if) on a trampoline."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e520c46c-d393-4e03-8bf5-2c7723a4bd6a",
                                                "sense_id": "bc60cc8b-3fc6-3662-b908-b8ee1ed63e74",
                                                "text": "My heart trampolined into my throat as I watched Lonnie's grip tighten on the stock of his own shotgun […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "93c5d50f-4c19-440e-97e8-817a4c19722f",
                                                "sense_id": "bc60cc8b-3fc6-3662-b908-b8ee1ed63e74",
                                                "text": "It would be helpful if data collected on sporting-related activities more clearly identified if the injuries occurred in organized sport or recreational activity. For example, children trampolining unsupervised in the garden may be at a higher risk than those in a supervised class but the relative degrees of risk are not known."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0e671448-1492-3732-ac9d-4624b5eb5126",
                                        "entry_id": "7cec9f49-1a5d-3042-87fd-bc9e23a75d2a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To rewrite (computer code) to use trampoline instructions."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b3bd6a19-4891-4cc2-be94-3a5807b3ebf4",
                                                "sense_id": "0e671448-1492-3732-ac9d-4624b5eb5126",
                                                "text": "trampolined code"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "64397b22-8760-4b58-9ff6-a22942139d38",
                        "source_entry_id": "0e5f28ff-d01b-386c-9797-74086c2358a6",
                        "source_sense_id": "3f37b4e4-7baa-3cb0-b58c-950fbbb30919",
                        "target_lang_word": "trampoline",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "trampoline",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "65a441a5-caed-30f4-a950-9813368c4eda",
                                        "entry_id": "5aa303df-e1d2-3fed-b323-d8d20b9958b9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Appareil constitué d’un cadre et d’une pièce élastique tendue par des ressorts, qui permet de rebondir."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7fc432f7-a5ed-485a-a381-fc2b04c3b887",
                                                "sense_id": "65a441a5-caed-30f4-a950-9813368c4eda",
                                                "text": "Les enfants ont joué sur le grand trampoline jusqu’au soir."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d76d2689-cce9-375b-9272-c2e4f53a8b79",
                                        "entry_id": "5aa303df-e1d2-3fed-b323-d8d20b9958b9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sport que l’on fait à l’aide d’un trampoline. Dans cette acception, il est indénombrable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ea9d4e8-f6f6-4684-b89d-1249fa6373b7",
                                                "sense_id": "d76d2689-cce9-375b-9272-c2e4f53a8b79",
                                                "text": "Tutoyer les sommets n’est pas vraiment un problème pour Allan Morante, champion d’Europe et vice-champion du monde de trampoline en 2022 : s’il est qualifié, le Français ne se contentera de rien d’autre qu’une médaille aux JO de Paris 2024, comme il l’expliquait jeudi dans notre émission « Les Croisés, tu connais », diffusée chaque jeudi sur Twitch."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "faaa4c83-c805-39c7-ba6a-566752fc38c7",
                                        "entry_id": "5aa303df-e1d2-3fed-b323-d8d20b9958b9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Fonction qui exécute quelques instructions puis effectue un saut inconditionnel."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "74ce3b44-00bb-404a-8ba7-494ceb3172e1",
                                                "sense_id": "faaa4c83-c805-39c7-ba6a-566752fc38c7",
                                                "text": "On installe un crochet en remplaçant les quelques premières instructions de la fonction système visée par un saut inconditionnel vers le crochet. Ce dernier, après avoir effectué quelques préparatifs, appelle une trampoline qui contient les instructions écrasées suivies d’un saut inconditionnel vers le reste des instructions originales. Lorsque la fonction originale se conclut, le contrôle retourne au crochet qui peut effectuer quelques « postparatifs » avant de finalement retourner le contrôle à l’appelant."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
